Package: com.samcejko.kodium-shell
Name: Kodium Shell
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Shells for Kodium's terminal
 iOS does not let an app of the App Store kind start processes, Kodium
 neither: this package's small daemon, started by launchd for each
 connection on 127.0.0.1:47070 only, runs a login shell (bash) on a pseudo
 terminal as the user mobile for Kodium's terminal panel. It answers only
 Kodium: a connection has to name the token Kodium keeps in its container.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Homepage: https://github.com/samcejko/kodium-ios6
Section: Terminal_Support
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0)
